# Data products: the .pkl files (~1.1 GB each) are not versioned. Clone the
# repo, download the simulations and run the pipeline to regenerate them.
# The run_config.json files ARE versioned: they are the exact recipe
# (command line, seeds, mass bins, impact grid) behind each realization.
data_*/*
!data_*/run_config.json

